	<section_number>63.2-1714</section_number>
	<catch_line>Duty of attorneys for the Commonwealth</catch_line>
	<text>
		It shall be the duty of the attorney for the Commonwealth of every county and city to prosecute all violations of this subtitle.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, §§ 63-227, 63-253; 1954, c. 259; 1968, c. 578, §§ 63.1-182, 63.1-216; 1973, c. 227; 1992, c. 356, § 63.1-194.12; 1993, cc. 957, 993; 2002, c. 747.</history>
